<BlogLayout
  title="P&amp;L vs Bank Statement Loans, and What a WVOE Really Is | Cliffco Mortgage"
  description="A WVOE is a form your employer fills in, not a loan. The two real lighter-documentation paths for a business owner are a 12-month P&amp;L loan and a bank statement loan. How each works and when it fits."
  type="article"
>
  <Breadcrumbs trail={[
    { name: "Home", href: "/" },
    { name: "Blog", href: "/mortgage-guides/blog/" },
    { name: "P&L vs Bank Statement Loan Guide", href: "/mortgage-guides/blog/pl-loan-vs-wvoe-loan-small-business-owner-mortgage/" },
